# RAE vendor patch

RAE carries a minimal fork of apicula under `tools/apicula/`.

## Changes

- `src/convert/gltf/mod.rs`: export `extras.rae.nitro` on each glTF material
  (`alpha`, `cullBackface`, `cullFrontface`, `textureAlpha`).

This metadata is consumed by `rae.glb_policy` when classifying materials for
preview and game export. Keep the diff small and extras-only when syncing with
upstream apicula.
